* H-bond test topology: N-H donor and C=O acceptor fragments, no charges, no LJ
*
36 1

MASS  -1  TN   14.007
MASS  -1  TH    1.008
MASS  -1  TC   12.011
MASS  -1  TO   15.999

RESI DNR   0.00      ! donor fragment: atom names N, H as in a backbone
GROUP
ATOM N   TN   0.00
ATOM H   TH   0.00
BOND N H
PATCH FIRST NONE LAST NONE

RESI ACR   0.00      ! acceptor fragment: atom names C, O as in a backbone
GROUP
ATOM C   TC   0.00
ATOM O   TO   0.00
BOND C O
PATCH FIRST NONE LAST NONE

END
